Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/libtests/makepng.c
Line: 240
Function: set_color
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: gamma_table is indexed using unvalidated component values (red/green/blue) passed from generate_palette via the user-controlled colors[] array. If colors[1..3] exceed 255 (e.g., via --colors with values >255), accesses like gamma_table[red] read past the 256-entry table, causing an out-of-bounds read.

Source context:
```c
